  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/xhtml.html#xml-fragment-parsing-algorithm\nWe pass to this algoritm some string and element as context. From 2.,3., 4. probably we will parse that structure: `<context>string</context>` and in step 7. we return child node of `<context></context>`. If that is how works this algorithm so why we have step 6.? Will `<context>` has ever any sibling? Even if this algo works in other way what about comment or PI nodes? They are correct for document element as sibling.  \n",
